  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/l4KUlJo.png\" alt=\"水域前線標誌\" width=\"935\" height=\"185\">歡迎來到水域前線 MOD！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">本模組為遊戲添加了多種新的水生生物，讓海洋更加生動！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">本模組新增五種實體：海綿魷魚、沙丁魚、珊瑚巨人、巨型魷魚和珊瑚蟹</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">每種新實體都包含自訂戰利品表、生成條件和行為模式</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">模組目前適用於版本 1.19.2、1.19.4、1.20.1 和 1.20.4</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">如有任何錯誤、問題或功能建議，請使用問題追蹤系統</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>需要 GECKOLIB</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">材質、模型和動畫由 CaptainAtlas 製作</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">程式編寫由 GlitchedMastery 負責</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">與 BisectHosting 合作：&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://bisecthosting.com/GlitchedMastery\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/GlitchedMastery</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">（使用代碼：GLITCHEDMASTERY 可享 25% 折扣！）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp